      "text": " \ufeff```json\n{\n  \"op\": \"-write_workspace\",\n    \"name\": \"simple_random_password_generator\",\n    \"text\": {\n      \"heading\": \"Simple Random Password Generator\",\n      \".content\": {\n        \"overview\": \"Created a simple random password generator in Python ensuring the password includes at least one lowercase letter, uppercase letter, digit, and\u7279\u6b8a\u5b57\u7b26\u3002\",\n        \"modules_used\": [\"string\", \"secrets\"],\n        \"safe_Punctuation\": \"`*_-.\",\n        \"function_description\": \"Generates a strong random password of a specified length.\",\n        \"functionDefinitions\": {\n          \"generate_safe_punctuation\": null,\n          \"generate_password': [\n            \"from string import jsonify\",\n            \"import secrets\",\n            \"safe_punctuation = '`*_-.',\",\n            \"def generate_safe_punctuation():\",\n            ->[\"return safe Punctuation\"],\n            \"def generate_password(length):\",\n            \"required_types = [\\nnascii_lowercase, ascii_uppercase, digits, safe_punctuation]\",\n            \"password_characters = []\",\n            \"for _type in required_types:',\n            ->[\"password_characters.extend(_type)\"],\n            \"if len(password Characters) < length:\",\n            ->[\"password_characters.append(secrets.choice(safe Punctuation))\"],\n            \"return ''.join(secrets.choice(password_characters)for _ in range(length)))\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"next_steps\":[\n            \"Conduct thorough tests\",\n            \"Allow customization of special characters\",\n             \"Improve documentation\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "actor": "child",
      "commit_record_index": 2467,
      "commit_record_sha256": "da0187357c94539831779fb93ad358079463f828f5f4d6db7385121033729b9e",
      "record_index": 2466,
      "record_sha256": "f56a7f463cb93cf9455b9bfbafaa7916c1cd2c68203b3bf4f4d11704e99708ed",
      "text": "```python\nfrom string import ascii_lowercase, ascii_uppercase, digits\nimport secrets\nsafe_punctuation = '`*_-.'\n\ndef generate_safe_punctuation():\n    return safe_punctuation\n\ndef generate_password(length):\n    required_types = [ascii_lowercase, ascii_uppercase, digits, safe_punctuation]\n    password_characters = []\n    for _type in required_types:\n        password_characters.extend(_type)\n    \n    if len(password_characters) < length:\n        password_characters.append(secrets.choice(safe_punctuation))\n    \n    return ''.join(secrets.choice(password_characters) for _ in range(length))\n\n# Example usage:\nprint(generate_password(12))\n```"
